# Jailbreak Scheme (spree, CR 702.172): {U} plus the chosen mode's cost. Mode 1 ({3}) puts a +1/+1 counter on target creature, and it
# can't be blocked this turn. Bot1 pays {U}{3} from four of its five Moxen (Emerald stays untapped, the pool empty after) for the
# Grizzly Bears, which attacks turn 3: Bot2's Ornithopter may not block it (CR 509.1b), so the 3/3 Bears connects and Bot2 is at 17.

